sequenceDiagram
  participant FE as Frontend (MealAnalysis.tsx)
  participant API as POST /api/ai/analyse-repas (ai_features.py)
  participant SEC as current_user (security.py)
  participant GV as GeminiVisionService (ai_enhanced.py)
  participant GEM as Gemini 2.5 Flash
  participant DS as document_store.py
  participant MG as MongoDB
  FE->>API: multipart image + Bearer access_token
  API->>SEC: vérifier le jeton, charger l'utilisateur
  SEC-->>API: utilisateur ACTIF
  API->>API: taille image > 10 Mo ? 413
  alt clé Gemini absente
    API->>DS: log_ai_call(status=unavailable)
    DS->>MG: insert ai_provider_calls
    API-->>FE: 503 « Gemini Vision non disponible »
  else clé présente
    API->>GV: analyze(image_bytes)
    GV->>GEM: image + consigne JSON
    GEM-->>GV: aliments détectés (ou vide)
    GV-->>API: liste (vide = fallback)
    API->>DS: log_ai_call(status=success | fallback)
    API->>DS: save_meal_analysis(payload)
    DS->>MG: insert food_analyses (ignoré si Mongo indisponible)
    API-->>FE: 200 MealAnalysisResponse
  end
